WEBVTT

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:03.190
W-What is this?

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:05.950
Jougasaki!

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:10.280
Spring is the season of 
hope and new encounters...

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:12.610
But what was waiting for me...

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:23.500
...was the first tempest of the year.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:28.960
<b>Episode 1: The Academy SKETs</b>

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.300
All set.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:42.220
<b>Year 2 Class C</b>

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:42.610
Uh, I'm going to introduce 
a new transfer student now.

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:45.970
I-I'm Sugihara Teppei!

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:47.550
It's nice to meet everyone!

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:50.880
Right. His name is Sugihara Teppei.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:52.650
Play nice with him, you guys.

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:53.800
Now, your seat...

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:56.960
The one over there, all the way in the back.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:57.990
Right.

00:00:58.420 --> 00:00:59.210
Uh...

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:01.150
Right, homeroom.

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.290
Or, whatever, really, I don't care.

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:05.550
Is there something?

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:07.180
Yes! The school beautification council has...

00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:09.100
What? That? For Pete's...

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:10.220
Sensei, um...

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:12.860
We had to move because of my father's work,

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.640
Make it short, okay?

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:13.310
Right.

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:15.630
so I've transferred here into 
Kaimei Academy, starting today.

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:15.630
Lately, the trash separation has...

00:01:22.220 --> 00:01:24.220
Finally, lunch time.

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:30.550
Hmm, I'm pretty sure the 
school store was over...

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:33.240
Somebody!

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:35.160
Somebody help me!

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:37.190
Like you, transfer student!

00:01:37.190 --> 00:01:37.960
Me?!

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:39.800
I'm being chased by a hoodlum!

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:40.790
A hoodlum?!

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:43.250
Wait, that's obviously bogus. 
We're in the school, so...

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:47.340
He's gonna sell me off! Overseas!

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:47.340
I heard you!

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:53.040
You can't run any longer, 
Missy! Missy. Missy...

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:55.180
And here comes the weird hoodlum!

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:57.880
Um, what kind of joke is this, seriously?

00:01:57.880 --> 00:01:59.340
I don't get it.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:01.890
Don't just stand there, run for it!

00:02:02.510 --> 00:02:04.180
Yeah! Come with us!

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:04.560
H-Hey!

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:05.430
Hold it!

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:09.020
Outta the way! Outta the way!

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:12.800
Hurry! We're being followed!

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:14.130
But, why?!

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:18.270
Who in the world are these people?

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:20.350
<b>School Store</b>

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:24.420
Looks like we're too late.

00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:27.030
It's 'cause you made us 
put on that weird act.

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:29.030
Um, what is...

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:31.690
The strawberry-milk bread 
here is pretty good!

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:33.740
Keep that in mind, transfer student!

00:02:33.740 --> 00:02:36.340
It's no fun eating by yourself, right?

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:38.300
If you'd like, come to our clubroom.

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:43.480
By the way, the upper classmen 
buy theirs in the morning.

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:45.350
Oh, come to think of it...

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:46.870
Move it!

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:47.940
Um, excuse me!

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:48.830
Let me through!

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:49.900
Shut it!

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:53.190
My life as an errand boy depends on this!

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:53.190
The three of them are my classmates.

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:57.400
It seems like they just started 
up a new club recently.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.960
So, you're the Academy Activity Support Club?

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:03.560
Sket-dan, for short.

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:08.830
<b>Sket-dan</b>

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:08.830
<b>We'll solve your troubles on the double! Come to us for help with any and all activities! Whether it's searching for lost items, or cleaning up the backyard, we always satisfy our clients!</b>

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:05.900
Come to us for help with any and all activities.

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:09.200
Whether it's searching for lost items, 
or cleaning up the backyard...

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:12.740
In other words, in order for the 
students to live a smooth,

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:14.630
easygoing campus life, we 
provide universal assistance.

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:16.100
That's right!

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:18.250
We'll solve any trouble on the double!

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:21.860
We're the academy's support 
group that everyone counts on!

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:22.590
Uh...

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:25.510
Hey, don't go spreading lies like that.

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:29.500
Everyone says that the 
Sket-dan's just for odd jobs.

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:31.660
Our reputation is awful...

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:34.980
That we don't have any clients, and just 
spend every day hanging out, doing nothing!

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:37.390
All cause the Leader is a big fat slack-ass!

00:03:37.390 --> 00:03:38.650
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:41.370
At least use words I can understand! 
You kinda hurt my feelings!

00:03:41.370 --> 00:03:44.160
Um, you don't really have 
to fight over this...

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:47.120
<b>Sket-dan
Now Accepting Requests</b>

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:46.520
You don't have to worry about it.

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:47.640
They're always like this.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:54.700
Sorry about showing you that side of me.

00:03:55.650 --> 00:03:56.410
Oh, right.

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:57.860
We haven't introduced ourselves.

00:03:57.860 --> 00:03:58.890
I'm...

00:03:57.860 --> 00:03:59.780
This here is our Amazonian Second in Command.

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:03.610
She's a dangerous creature 
so don't get too close.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:06.100
Her acidic juices might get on your body...

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:06.890
She'll melt you.

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:09.350
Stop making crap up!

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:11.580
Look at him! The transfer 
student's cowering in fear!

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:14.340
She beat him! In a flash!

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:18.340
Well, I had a period there when 
I was a bit, rambunctious...

00:04:18.340 --> 00:04:19.920
But you don't need to be afraid.

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:23.010
I'm very well behaved now! Like a hamster!

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:27.760
I ain't never seen a hamster 
as violent as you, dumbass!

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:28.820
Fine, I got you!

00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:29.510
Don't move an inch!

00:04:29.510 --> 00:04:31.100
I'll impale you and the 
transfer student together!

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:32.490
What? Me too? Why?

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:33.880
Onizuka Hime.

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:35.470
Nickname: Himeko.

00:04:35.470 --> 00:04:40.870
Once known as "Onihime", the now legendary 
"yankee" more powerful than anyone.

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:41.580
H-Hey, there's no need to say all that!

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:44.110
Born July 7th, blood type B. Cancer.

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:47.540
Her favorite food is octopus-wasabi 
flavored pelollipops.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:47.540
Hey, that's enough.

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:50.470
Height: 162 centimeters. 
Weight: XX kilograms.

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:50.970
How the hell do you know that?!

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:52.590
Her bust, waist, and hip are, respectively...

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:52.590
Where the did you find that out?

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:54.700
You think that makes you so cool, huh?!

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:57.220
Her bodily fluids are naturally 
highly acidic and...

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:57.220
Hold it!

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:01.670
Um, I've been wondering about 
this, but what's with him?

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:03.150
Oh, him?

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:06.410
I am Switch. Usui Kazuyoshi.

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:10.340
I don't really get it, but it seems 
like he doesn't want to talk himself.

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:12.720
So he uses a custom speech 
simplesist software...

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:13.340
Speech synthesis software.

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:14.660
...to speak.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:17.550
He can find out any personal 
info in an instant.

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:19.920
Better not to get too close to him.

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:24.160
For your information, I was born 
Feb. 28th, blood type AB, Pisces.

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:26.590
My favorite Visored is Muguruma Kensei.

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:28.010
Who the hell is that?!

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:33.680
And I am the leader of the Sket-dan, 
Bossun!  Fujisaki Yuusuke!

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:37.170
Well, there's only us 3 members.

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:39.280
But we're always like this, pretty much.

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:42.240
If you ever have any trouble, come on by.

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:43.230
We'll help you out.

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:45.670
Right. Thank you for the offer.

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:48.570
Phew... I thought they were 
going to force me to join.

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:50.170
Of course...

00:05:50.170 --> 00:05:52.080
You'll be joining our Sket-dan, riiight?

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:54.600
We'll give you this soccer ticket 
and this laundry detergent.

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:55.880
Now sign here.

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:57.120
I knew it!

00:05:58.140 --> 00:06:00.460
But I think clubs aren't for me...

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:02.860
I'm not very good at making friends, see...

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:08.130
I've received information from a 
witness to the "Hageitou" incident.

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:10.240
It is just as you suspected, Bossun.

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:10.900
For real?!

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:13.050
Okay! Let's identify the culprit!

00:06:13.050 --> 00:06:15.460
Oh? They're actually pretty 
serious about this.

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:17.750
W-What is this Hageitou incident?

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:18.350
Here.

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:22.080
Oh my god, a murder?!

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:23.010
No, no...

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:26.700
Hage Itou?

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:30.400
<b>[Note: "Hage" means bald]</b>

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:29.880
Yeah, see... It got out that 
Itou-sensei wears a hairpiece.

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:31.930
He was barely holding back 
tears, forcing a smile...

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:33.300
Poor thing.

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:38.150
We've been investigating the graffiti under 
the codename "Hageitou Incident."

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:38.150
<b>[Note: "Hageitou" means Amaranthus tricolor, an ornamental flower]</b>

00:06:38.150 --> 00:06:39.790
Oh, I see...

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:43.900
Can't touch this! I'm hot stuff...

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:45.190
That's not cool.

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:47.580
Hi, hope you had a great first day!

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:49.920
Hey, do you want us to give 
you a tour of the campus?

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:52.390
N-No, I'm okay by myself!

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:54.640
That was fast.

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:56.090
He's avoiding us.

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:57.790
My fault?

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:04.430
It's actually a pretty big school. And 
there are plenty of different clubs.

00:07:04.430 --> 00:07:05.800
Maybe I should...

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:07.720
No way.

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:09.880
I'm sure there's something else I want to do.

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:13.020
<b>Please don't feed the fish</b>

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:16.280
Damn, this pisses me off!

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:19.650
Screw this! How'd we get caught?

00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:22.150
I'll never forgive those 
bastards in the Sket-dan!

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:23.810
I'll get them for this!

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:25.880
These guys must be the ones behind that incident...

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:26.530
Sneakin' around behind the scenes like that!

00:07:26.530 --> 00:07:29.660
But that Onihime we've heard 
about is in the Sket-dan.

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:31.900
And w-what about it?

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:34.390
Everyone keeps makin' fun o' me!

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:39.120
What have you done now?

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:46.110
Who was that?

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:50.480
A transfer student. If I recall, his 
name is Sugihara and he's in class C.

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:55.420
Sheesh, I'm bored.

00:07:55.420 --> 00:07:57.460
I wonder if anything'll come our way?

00:07:57.460 --> 00:07:58.860
Like what?

00:07:58.860 --> 00:08:04.640
Say, the door opens suddenly, and behind 
it is a victim covered in blood...

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:06.570
P-Please help me!

00:08:06.930 --> 00:08:08.990
Yeah, just like that.

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:16.340
You're covered in blood!

00:08:16.340 --> 00:08:19.500
Uh, you're mistaken! This is paint!

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:23.090
What? Paint? Don't scare me like that, man...

00:08:23.090 --> 00:08:23.880
...hey!

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:24.690
What happened?

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:26.700
Um, you see, just before...

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:30.610
I was looking at the koi in 
the pond behind the gymnasium.

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:31.360
And then...

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:42.560
It was like I was dreaming or something...

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:44.990
Almost as if it were some horror story...

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:46.440
As if.

00:08:46.440 --> 00:08:49.570
I ain't heard of an afterlife 
where ghosts drop paint on ya.

00:08:49.570 --> 00:08:50.850
Y-You have a point...

00:08:50.850 --> 00:08:53.140
However, I doubt that a 
new transfer student like you

00:08:53.140 --> 00:08:55.130
would have someone with a grudge against you.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:56.580
If it was a random criminal act,

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:58.580
then there is a high possibility 
there will be another victim.

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.420
I think so too, and that's why I came here.

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:03.540
I figured, this is a job for the Sket-dan!

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:06.660
Oh? Looks like the transfer student gets it!

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:07.480
But!

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:11.410
I'd rather it not involve me too much...

00:09:11.810 --> 00:09:15.400
If it got around that something like this 
happened to a new transfer student so soon, then...

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:17.420
Yeah.

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:19.350
Secret investigations are our specialty!

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:22.660
We'll catch this "Paint Mask" 
before anyone ever notices!

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:23.490
Leave it to us!

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:26.320
Right. Thank you.

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:27.970
Got it, dudes?

00:09:27.970 --> 00:09:29.430
Tomorrow, we start the ingest...

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:30.960
...the investigation!

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:32.020
He stammered?

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:33.440
So close! If you'd only said it right...

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:35.690
What? Don't be so picky!

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:37.130
Fine, I'll do it again!

00:09:36.530 --> 00:09:40.970
And that's how I was wrapped up in an 
incident right after I transferred.

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:37.970
Start the instiga...

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:40.970
S-Start the gastr...

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:45.160
Sket Dance!

00:09:49.470 --> 00:09:50.980
Sket Dance!

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:54.350
So I told her...

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:59.150
"I already have an angel, so 
I can't fly on your wings..."

00:10:00.170 --> 00:10:01.680
Ma-kun, you're so slick!

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:02.380
Hey!

00:10:04.130 --> 00:10:06.950
We gots something we needs to ask ya.

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:09.300
W-What?

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:11.010
Ma-kun, I'm scared!

00:10:11.010 --> 00:10:12.460
Don't be scared!

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:15.560
You two lovebirds perch there 
all the time, don't ya?

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:18.490
I asked ya if you come here every day?!

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:18.940
Man, he's loud...

00:10:19.710 --> 00:10:23.390
You guys didn't see anyone 
suspicious around here, did you?

00:10:25.110 --> 00:10:29.870
Did ya see any evil lookin' 
dude that seemed outta place?!

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:31.390
She seems pretty suspicious herself...

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:32.770
N-No...

00:10:33.140 --> 00:10:34.920
But when it comes to evil lookin',

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:39.740
I saw Jougasaki and his buddy 
painting over graffiti on the wall.

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:41.840
Painting? Jougasaki?

00:10:41.840 --> 00:10:47.060
I believe that Mr. Itou ordered them to paint 
over the previously mentioned graffiti yesterday.

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:47.870
I see.

00:10:48.110 --> 00:10:51.710
Anyway, later fools-in-love.
And give it a rest already.

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:52.990
You'll break up soon, anyway.

00:10:52.990 --> 00:10:55.110
Yeah, take it down a notch, seriously!

00:10:55.110 --> 00:10:56.620
You're embarrassing just to look at!

00:10:56.620 --> 00:10:59.070
Hey! Why're you throwing those 
lines out while you run for it?

00:10:59.070 --> 00:11:00.370
Kosaka Masatoshi.

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:03.740
A crafty conversationalist, he's dated 
up to three girls at once in the past.

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:09.150
Lately he's bragged to his friends about how 
he's only aiming for stupid, easily duped girls.

00:11:09.420 --> 00:11:11.140
H-How did you find that out?

00:11:11.140 --> 00:11:12.480
Ma-kun...

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:15.700
Uh, you're cute when 
you're angry, my angel...

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:16.750
Ma-kun!

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:17.310
Right...

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:26.270
Jougasaki is definitely a bad enough dude to do 
something like this, so it's a possibility; however...

00:11:26.270 --> 00:11:29.680
If we accuse him without any 
proof, it will backfire.

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:32.580
I'll leave you to investigate his background.

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:35.590
We'll tail him and get us some evidence.

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:39.220
Um, does this "we" include me?

00:11:39.220 --> 00:11:40.700
You bet, rookie!

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:42.210
We're the Sket-dan!

00:11:42.210 --> 00:11:43.300
All for one and one for all!

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:47.650
I think I'll just hold you back, 
so I'll go wait in the clubroom.

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:52.970
But I wanna finally show off our 
tailin' skills to our new member!

00:11:52.970 --> 00:11:55.070
I told you already, I'm not joining!

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:58.470
And that's why I told him:

00:11:58.470 --> 00:12:00.440
"You got a big mouth for such a weakling!"

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:03.200
Then he was shaking like a leaf!

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:08.920
Acting like that, it's a safe bet they've 
done something they oughta feel guilty about.

00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:17.960
What the hell is with you 
using an afro as a disguise?!

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:20.460
You stick out like a sore 
thumb, you friggin' idiot!

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:22.420
I ain't frizzin'!

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:25.950
This is camouflage that allows 
me to blend into the bushes!

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:27.420
It don't look anything like the bushes!

00:12:27.420 --> 00:12:29.850
You look like some old dude with a perm!

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:30.500
That stinks!

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:32.520
You're the one who set it on fire!

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:33.430
Sheesh... Huh?

00:12:35.180 --> 00:12:37.280
Look! We lost track of them.

00:12:39.870 --> 00:12:41.380
You search over that way!

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:42.000
Right!

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:47.450
Watch out, Bossun!

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:47.800
Huh?

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:54.530
Bossun, you okay?

00:12:54.530 --> 00:12:55.570
Bossun!

00:12:57.870 --> 00:12:58.820
Sorry.

00:12:59.490 --> 00:13:00.840
Whatever, after him!

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:02.000
R-Right!

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:04.300
You ain't gettin' away!

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:09.090
Oww...

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:10.650
It's you!

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:12.030
Oh, the Sket-dan...

00:13:12.030 --> 00:13:13.400
Himeko, where'd he go?

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:14.070
Oh, right!

00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:19.170
Jougasaki, as we thought.

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:21.390
He's a fast one, ain't he?

00:13:21.390 --> 00:13:24.350
You sure have a knack for 
spoilin' things, don't cha?

00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:26.670
W-What? What'd I do?

00:13:26.900 --> 00:13:29.570
So, you were always right here?

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:30.310
Yeah...

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:33.450
Thanks to you guys, Yumi-chan dumped me...

00:13:34.320 --> 00:13:36.150
That was all Switch.

00:13:36.150 --> 00:13:41.080
After that, I just stood there, looking 
at my reflection in the pond...

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:45.890
I, like that pond, had now lost my "koi".

00:13:45.490 --> 00:13:49.050
<b>[koi = type of fish]</b>

00:13:45.490 --> 00:13:49.050
<b>[koi = love]</b>

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:49.370
Do you have to sound like 
a smartass <i>all</i> the time?

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:52.920
Bossun, what's wrong?

00:13:53.170 --> 00:13:55.030
Why wasn't he a victim?

00:13:55.030 --> 00:13:55.390
Huh?

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:58.520
Why wasn't he targeted?

00:14:01.850 --> 00:14:03.190
It's a mail from Switch...

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:04.860
What the hell is with that ringtone?!

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:06.020
Good work! (*-∇-)/♪

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:07.630
Finished with the investigation 
of Jougasaki! \(￣o￣)/

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:10.430
I got lots of info! I'll tell you 
all 'bout it late(＊`∀')b-rs!

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:11.410
b((((≧▽≦))))9 Shake-shake!

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:14.880
God damn his mails are high-strung.

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:16.450
Now, now... (＊＾o＾)ﾉ”(~~;)

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:17.660
Don't be so mad.

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:18.480
(SPARKLE SMILE) (｡∀・)ゞ

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:20.080
How the hell is he responding to me?

00:14:21.430 --> 00:14:23.020
Actually, I'm nearby.

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:23.710
☆(・ω・*) *glance*

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:24.330
*glance*

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:25.710
You were here the whole time?!

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:29.020
So, when Jougasaki was in elementary school,

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:33.690
it seems he made a game of playing 
pranks on people and then running away.

00:14:33.690 --> 00:14:35.950
So, have you figured anything out?

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:37.980
No, just a little longer...

00:14:39.030 --> 00:14:40.770
I'm gonna piece it all together now.

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:43.040
Piece what all together?

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:45.030
It's best not to speak to him at the moment.

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:47.240
He's entered his "concentration mode."

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:51.830
When Bossun puts on his goggles, his 
concentration level shoots way up.

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:54.740
When Bossun gets like this, 
he's actually kinda awesome.

00:14:55.100 --> 00:14:56.200
They're on!

00:15:11.170 --> 00:15:15.400
Amazing... I can actually feel his 
intense state of concentration!

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:24.460
Bossun!

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:27.150
Man, I'm beat...

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:31.740
Now then... I'll tell you the plan.

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:35.870
Everyone, go home!

00:15:37.670 --> 00:15:38.330
Huh?

00:15:43.980 --> 00:15:45.460
We'll lure him out.

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:48.180
He won't target us unless we're alone, see...

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:54.530
But will you be okay alone, Bossun?

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:56.180
Sure, leave it to me.

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:02.380
Psych!

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:05.880
Don't move.

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:08.400
Good, Himeko. Nice job.

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:09.250
Now keep him...

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:10.890
Move, and I strip the skin off yer face.

00:16:10.890 --> 00:16:13.200
That's scary, man! Just take off his mask!

00:16:14.310 --> 00:16:16.870
I sent the real plan afterwards by mail.

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:19.670
Face it, you've lost, Paint Mask.

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:22.970
Well, I know who you are already...

00:16:23.510 --> 00:16:24.550
...transfer student!

00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:28.740
Y-You've got it all wrong!

00:16:28.740 --> 00:16:32.250
What are you talking about?
I was j-just checking out the area, and...

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:33.570
Holding a can of paint?

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:38.260
You said that you looked 
at the koi in the pond.

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:39.780
I can't believe that.

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:44.700
You probably got the wrong idea from the 
sign, but there's no koi in there right now.

00:16:45.450 --> 00:16:48.620
Yup. There haven't been any since last year.

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:51.380
Therefore, the incident you 
told us about was a lie.

00:16:51.380 --> 00:16:55.490
The reason you came to us with a request 
was to lure us out behind the gymnasium.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:57.730
Your target is the Sket-dan!

00:16:57.730 --> 00:16:59.840
And Jougasaki gave you the orders!

00:16:59.840 --> 00:17:00.580
Right?

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:03.510
J-Jougasaki? Who's that?

00:17:03.510 --> 00:17:04.730
I just transferred here, so...

00:17:04.730 --> 00:17:06.350
Sugihara Teppei...

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:10.120
When you were in elementary 
school, you lived near here.

00:17:10.350 --> 00:17:12.550
Jougasaki was in the same grade as you.

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:18.270
So you saw through everything?

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:23.100
That's right. I was bullied by Jougasaki.

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:24.840
The entire time in elementary school...

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:27.470
And then you moved at the 
same time you graduated.

00:17:27.470 --> 00:17:29.770
You moved back to this town, then.

00:17:30.170 --> 00:17:33.340
I thought this would be my 
chance to remake myself.

00:17:33.340 --> 00:17:36.950
But Jougasaki is here in this high school!

00:17:37.560 --> 00:17:39.520
Hey, Teppei!

00:17:39.520 --> 00:17:41.770
It's me, Jougasaki!

00:17:41.770 --> 00:17:43.670
We were together in elementary 
school, remember?

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:46.640
Let's play a little game of truth 
or dare, for old time's sake.

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:48.360
We used to do this all the time, remember?

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:52.040
I dare you to cover one 
of the Sket-dan in paint.

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:54.860
And you know what'll happen 
if you don't do it, right?

00:17:59.980 --> 00:18:01.050
And so I...

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:07.700
Pouring it on yourself was to 
camouflage what really happened.

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:11.990
If you were a victim, there 
was no way you'd be a suspect.

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:15.980
But why'd you do everything 
Jougasaki says like that?

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:18.770
You think it's stupid, I bet.

00:18:19.230 --> 00:18:22.140
But for me, it's a big problem.

00:18:22.460 --> 00:18:23.560
You're laughing at me, I'm sure.

00:18:24.340 --> 00:18:26.040
I ain't laughing.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:27.780
This isn't funny at all.

00:18:27.780 --> 00:18:31.710
Even though Bossun's lazy, he went 
out of his way to make this club.

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.110
He's a weirdo, right?

00:18:33.110 --> 00:18:37.680
But he made it because he 
wants to help people like you.

00:18:37.680 --> 00:18:39.120
It's no use.

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:40.950
I can't go against him!

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:46.480
A person like me can't have a peaceful 
campus life if I stand up to him!

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:49.410
I can't have it escalate 
by going against him...

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:52.900
I'll just try not to bother anyone, 
and get through it somehow!

00:18:56.730 --> 00:18:58.370
What the hell are you doing?

00:18:58.370 --> 00:18:59.310
Scary!

00:18:59.310 --> 00:19:02.860
I ain't gonna push you and say something 
like "Get the courage and stand up to him!"

00:19:02.860 --> 00:19:05.620
If you could do that, it 
wouldn't have come to this.

00:19:06.320 --> 00:19:08.240
All you needed to do is tell me.

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:10.680
Say "I gotta cover you in paint."

00:19:10.680 --> 00:19:14.000
If a friend's in trouble, 
the Sket-dan will save him!

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:15.200
A friend?

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:18.500
What's being covered in a little paint?!

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:26.660
I... I lied to my friends...

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:28.380
You don't got time to cry, right?

00:19:28.380 --> 00:19:29.850
I thought you were remaking yourself.

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:31.650
Friends, clubs...

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:36.700
You'll experience all 
kinds of new things now!

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:39.660
Right!

00:19:41.570 --> 00:19:43.100
Now then...

00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:46.520
Where are you watching from, Jougasaki?

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:48.830
Crap, they knew!

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:49.810
Over there?

00:19:49.810 --> 00:19:51.230
Wait, Jougasaki's here?

00:19:51.230 --> 00:19:54.430
Yes. He's definitely nearby, watching.

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:58.440
Now then... Time to finish this, Teppei!

00:19:59.850 --> 00:20:01.660
She's already gone!

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:03.910
Jougasaki!

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:07.780
O-Onihime!

00:20:07.780 --> 00:20:10.290
Ever heard of something called a door?

00:20:10.290 --> 00:20:12.410
You know what this is about.

00:20:12.410 --> 00:20:15.570
Oh, Teppei? We were just kidding around...

00:20:15.570 --> 00:20:17.010
I wasn't bein' serious...

00:20:17.010 --> 00:20:18.720
Take responsibility!

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:22.640
The bully always says it's a joke.

00:20:22.970 --> 00:20:25.930
But to the one being 
bullied, it's dead serious!

00:20:25.930 --> 00:20:27.200
Get ready for it!

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:28.790
Damn it!

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:57.410
Fight a little yourselves!

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:12.990
What? He joined the basketball team?

00:21:12.990 --> 00:21:14.230
Why?

00:21:14.230 --> 00:21:16.950
He's always been interested in basketball.

00:21:17.350 --> 00:21:20.790
He decided to do what he enjoys, and 
got up the courage to join, it seems.

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:26.090
By the way, his blood type is A, and 
his favorite Mobile Suit is Victory.

00:21:22.250 --> 00:21:24.110
Good for him.

00:21:24.910 --> 00:21:25.800
Yeah.

00:21:26.530 --> 00:21:29.300
Putting that aside, it seems 
we have a new request.

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:34.640
Bossun, I think I'll be 
able to make new friends.

00:21:35.300 --> 00:21:37.040
That's an odd wristband.

00:21:37.670 --> 00:21:40.400
Oh, this? It was given to me.

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:42.900
As a proof of friendship.

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:45.820
I think I can change.

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:47.400
From now on, in all sorts of ways...

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:54.320
President, about last 
year's budget reports...

00:21:54.320 --> 00:21:56.950
Hey, you heard of this "Sket-dan"?

00:22:01.950 --> 00:22:02.860
Huh?

00:22:02.860 --> 00:22:04.220
Hey! Is the request...

00:22:04.220 --> 00:22:06.620
Yes. They would like our help.

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:10.760
Well, I guess it makes sense 
for us to fix it, but still...

00:22:10.760 --> 00:22:13.640
Hi there! We came to answer your request.

00:22:14.050 --> 00:22:16.070
Oh, it's you three.

00:22:16.070 --> 00:22:17.200
Thanks for your help.

00:22:17.200 --> 00:22:18.330
Who were you again?

00:22:18.580 --> 00:22:20.120
Sket-dan -su!

00:23:51.140 --> 00:23:54.000
I art known as Takemitsu Shinzou!

00:23:54.000 --> 00:23:54.820
What century is this?

00:23:54.820 --> 00:23:56.770
Why's there a samurai at our school?!

00:23:56.770 --> 00:23:57.500
Yabasu!

00:23:57.500 --> 00:23:58.980
Worry not!

00:23:58.980 --> 00:24:00.880
This is a "repurika"-degozaru!

00:24:00.880 --> 00:24:01.960
I didn't ask!

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:03.720
He is the captain of the kendo team.

00:24:03.720 --> 00:24:05.170
As you can see, he lives in the present day.

00:24:05.170 --> 00:24:06.420
Oh, I get it.

00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:08.500
So, what's the request?

00:24:08.500 --> 00:24:09.720
Listen to I!

00:24:09.720 --> 00:24:12.080
When I hath a match...

00:24:12.080 --> 00:24:14.020
Next time: Peppermint Samurai!

00:24:14.020 --> 00:24:14.400
What?!

00:24:14.400 --> 00:24:15.010
Yabasu!

00:24:15.010 --> 00:24:16.920
We're the academy support group!

00:24:16.920 --> 00:24:18.060
Sket Dance!
